<title>UK: Sri Lanka tenders to buy white sugar -traders.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka tenders to buy white sugar -traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka tendered on Wednesday to buy one cargo of white sugar, traders said.</p>
<p>The tender specified that the sugar was for April delivery, they added.</p>
<p>Further details have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
